    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 82,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. Did you see the new bus lane on King Street? It opened last Monday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc28f85d2e2870b5d9f340511deac0d345ea82a33a86a256a7325c76e044e9e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 88,
        "sourceEnd": 215,
        "text": "Yes, I did. But I'm not sure it's fair. The lane was built very quickly, and now the shops on that street are losing customers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "1f31b2c7d4377cefaa2faefeaa5b4da5062f47ff8ac7f84a77af0fe79228be7f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 222,
        "sourceEnd": 302,
        "text": "Really? I thought the bus lane would help everyone. Buses are faster now, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "27285142dfbb0f60eb94ab89d7b3134aa21330b641b1fdac13f9d9ca475763cd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 308,
        "sourceEnd": 562,
        "text": "They are, but only for people who take the bus. The problem is that the lane was placed on the busiest shopping street. First, the council removed all the parking spaces. Then, they painted the lane red. After that, they banned cars from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "1856b7cb83bb0cdcee11d638a2e23ae94c6520394dec5fa719c2195bbf397d86",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 569,
        "sourceEnd": 629,
        "text": "So shop owners are angry because their customers can't park?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "38da50d637052775055eba6a3fa4247033de47c688925a220c6b2bc994329778",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 635,
        "sourceEnd": 815,
        "text": "Exactly. The shop owners who were interviewed by the local newspaper said their sales dropped by 30 percent. One owner, Mrs. Chen, who runs a bakery, said she might close her shop.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "c10f7a34ec3eb40d802f84cdd5ef4ebb5aad7522fd3f5e85ca7cb783e81bc1d9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 822,
        "sourceEnd": 885,
        "text": "That's terrible. But the bus passengers are happy, aren't they?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "02a9a798591437d05705ed7cdf24cc376c732f1ae4fa667fa45518f0eb8c3f5c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 891,
        "sourceEnd": 1064,
        "text": "Many are. The bus ride from the station to the market, which used to take 25 minutes, now takes only 12 minutes. People who live far from the city center save a lot of time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "589187b2f5f5055608271c08e9cf59dc34069823897efb4a69ec11e9bd506f7d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1071,
        "sourceEnd": 1160,
        "text": "So the policy helps some people and hurts others. Is the council doing anything about it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e2aebd02621f507eda6fa29448cde345e87976db306ea71a5209bf9e45704d03",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1166,
        "sourceEnd": 1311,
        "text": "They are reviewing the plan. A meeting was held last night, and the council promised to listen to shop owners. But no decision has been made yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "cc42e7080298925853bc7e512de6dc8130cfc072aec44e3cf6767a47ae5d47a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1318,
        "sourceEnd": 1383,
        "text": "I see. Maybe they could add some parking spaces on a side street.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "83d6e267dc5c1329bcaa442c5754ac87b3be86b5566b72f6598811a0c8fd3f6c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1389,
        "sourceEnd": 1482,
        "text": "That's a good idea. The council said they would consider it. But for now, the bus lane stays.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6b0abfddfb62c98d55a90355fc48178ff334c3278880a8a6ffed339e2872afa1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1489,
        "sourceEnd": 1637,
        "text": "It sounds like a difficult situation. The council has to balance the needs of different groups. I hope they find a solution that works for everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "edf02affdefe37b422627734100b49cbd8395f7a96a9e4898599c759b5fba6c6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1643,
        "sourceEnd": 1818,
        "text": "Me too. The bus lane has clear benefits for public transport, but the shop owners' concerns are real. The review will be important. Let's see what happens at the next meeting.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "cf3d159a6c617f4bc9e516b25ee23d1dc13b41e488e1406c454eb6d3d1d99a42",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
